# One line ending in the repository, whatever each machine checks out with.
# Mixed CRLF and LF inside a single file cost us a bad afternoon.
# And LF in every working copy too: Git for Windows sets core.autocrlf=true for the whole
# system, so each checkout, merge and new worktree wrote CRLF and pnpm test failed on that.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.svg text
